# Ōzakura pilot v2 — Chapter 3 "Windows" (source script; syntax in the header of ch01.ozs)
# Outline: production/pilot-v2/scene-outline.md, "Ch3 — Windows" (approved by the author Nov 1) and the "### Ch3" targets.
# Built from the shipped Ch3 (script.json, c3_ IDs; kept and adapted lines keep their IDs), minus Yuzu, "You're late",
# the recognition at the tree, the near-confession, the best of five and "Next Saturday", the fairy talk and the
# confessions (outline). New lines take IDs from c3_0309.

