== c3_window | The window
@bg bg_kohei_room_night
> I take a shower. I put the lunch boxes to soak. I set the rice for tomorrow.  #c3_0095
> When I come upstairs, her light's on, and her window's open, and she's waiting.  #c3_0096
> Our rooms face each other across the gap between the houses, a gap so narrow that when we were little we ran a string between our windows with two paper cups, and were disappointed when it didn't work. We've passed a lot of books across it since.  #c3_0097
> I open my window. The night air is cool and smells like wet earth from the hill behind the houses.  #c3_0099
@cg cg_window slow
> Nanoha's leaning on her windowsill in her pajamas, her hair piled up in a bun on top of her head with the enormous soft scrunchie she's had since middle school.  #c3_0100
> She's holding up a white rabbit plushie in both hands, solemnly, at arm's length.  #c3_0101
kohei(neutral): "…Who's that." || ……誰だ、それ。  #c3_0102
nanoha: "{Usagi-san|Mr. Rabbit}." || うさぎさん。  #c3_0103
kohei(deadpan): "I know it's {Usagi-san|Mr. Rabbit}. I bought you {Usagi-san|Mr. Rabbit}." || うさぎさんだってことは知ってる。買ってやったの、俺だろ。  #c3_0104
nanoha: "He's in time-out." || 今、反省中なの。  #c3_0105
> She sets him on the corner of the sill with his back to me. His little tail points straight at my window.  #c3_0106
kohei(neutral): "What did he do?" || 何やったんだ。  #c3_0107
nanoha: "We don't discuss it." || それは、言えません。  #c3_0108
kohei(smile): "He's been in time-out on and off since you were ten." || お前が十歳の頃から、出たり入ったりしてるだろ。  #c3_0111
nanoha: "He's a repeat offender." || 常習犯なの。  #c3_0112
> I lean out and reach across the gap. My fingertips just make it to his ear, and I turn him around to face the window.  #c3_0113
nanoha: "Kōhei." || こうへい。  #c3_0114
kohei(smile): "He looked lonely." || さびしそうだったから。  #c3_0115
nanoha: "You are undermining my authority." || 私の権威を、損なっています。  #c3_0116
kohei(grin): "Your authority is a plushie." || お前の権威って、ぬいぐるみだろ。  #c3_0117
nanoha: "My authority is absolute." || 私の権威は、絶対です。  #c3_0118
> She turns him back around without looking away from me. Her face is perfectly straight. Her eyes are laughing.  #c3_0119
> This is the version of her nobody else gets. Not Hoshikawa, not the first-years who bow to her in the hallway. Just me, across three feet of night.  #c3_0120
@cg cg_window_sill
> She props her chin on her folded arms on the sill.  #c3_0312
nanoha: "…Don't be mad at her." || ……あかねちゃんのこと、怒らないであげてね。  #c3_0122
kohei(neutral): "I'm not. I'd have come, that's all." || 怒ってない。行ったのに、ってだけだ。  #c3_0123
nanoha: "I know. That's why." || 知ってる。だからだよ。  #c3_0124
kohei(deadpan): "That's what Akane said." || あかねも、同じこと言ってた。  #c3_0125
nanoha: "Akane-chan's smart." || あかねちゃんは、賢いから。  #c3_0126
> The wind moves the trees on the hill. Somewhere down the lane, a cat yells at another cat.  #c3_0127
