== c3_saturday | Saturday practice
@card Saturday, April 12
@bg bg_dojo
@wear kohei kendo
@bgm practice
> Saturday practice is like any Saturday: warm-ups, practice swings, drills until my forearms burn.  #c3_0169
> Takatsuki was on the floor before anyone, doing his practice swings alone at the far end. Saturday doesn't change that either.  #c3_0324
@show kirishima kendo_calm c
kirishima: "Last half hour, free sparring. Fujisawa. Mizuno." || 最後の三十分は地稽古。ふじさわ。みずの。  #c3_0325
@hide kirishima
> She's good. I knew that on Wednesday.  #c3_0326
> I still take most of what there is to take. Her strikes are fast and clean, but I've got the reach, and when I come in hard she gives ground.  #c3_0327
> But she's always already there. Every feint I throw, she waits out. Every time I start to move, her sword tip is already where I'm going.  #c3_0328
> And I can't read her at all. I watch her shoulders, her hands, the tip of her sword. Nothing tells me anything until she's moving.  #c3_0329
> Kirishima-senpai calls time. We bow.  #c3_0172
@show natsuki kendo_grin r
> Afterward, kneeling against the wall with her helmet off, Mizuno looks as pleased with herself as if she'd won.  #c3_0173
kohei(smile): "You didn't get much." || 大して取れてなかったな。  #c3_0330
natsuki<smile>: "You lift your right heel before you feint. Every time." || きみ、フェイントの前に、右のかかとが上がるよね。毎回。  #c3_0331
@show takatsuki kendo_calm l
takatsuki: "Fujisawa. Mizuno still drops her left shoulder before {men|head strikes}. You did not see it once. I am telling you so that it is fair." || ふじさわ。みずのは、めんを打つ前に、まだ左肩が下がる。一度も気づいていなかった。公平のために言っておく。  #c3_0332
natsuki<surprised>: "Takatsuki-kun!" || たかつきくん！  #c3_0333
> He bows to both of us and goes back to his practice swings.  #c3_0334
@hide takatsuki
natsuki<curious>: "Are you going up to the shrine after this?" || このあと、神社行くの？  #c3_0335
kohei(neutral): "Trash bags." || ゴミ袋な。  #c3_0336
natsuki<smile>: "I'm going that way anyway." || 私も、どうせそっち行くから。  #c3_0337
kohei(neutral): "The station's the other way." || 駅は反対だぞ。  #c3_0339
natsuki<grin>: "Then I'm taking the long way." || じゃあ、遠回りする。  #c3_0340
