@bg bg_shrine_steps
@wear kohei school
@bgm natsuki
> The way up to the shrine starts a little past our houses: a stone stairway through the cedars, steep enough that the old people in the neighborhood count the landings out loud.  #c3_0341
@show natsuki track_smile c
> Mizuno has changed into a navy track shirt and dark sweats, her hair still up from practice. A camera hangs from a strap around her neck. A real one this time, black and heavy, with a lens that probably cost more than my bike.  #c3_0342
natsuki<curious>: "On the bridge, you asked me something." || 橋の上で、きみ、聞いたよね。  #c3_0343
kohei(neutral): "Did I?" || そうだったか？  #c3_0344
natsuki<smile>: "'What is?' And I didn't answer." || 「何が」って。私、答えなかったでしょ。  #c3_0345
natsuki<wistful>: "My project. It's you, doing one thing just because it's fun." || 私の課題。きみが、楽しいってだけで、何かひとつすること。  #c3_0346
> She says it fast and quiet, to the step in front of her.  #c3_0347
natsuki<grin>: "With progress reports. I bet you can't keep it up for a month." || 進捗報告つきでね。一か月も続かないと思うけど？  #c3_0348
kohei(deadpan): "It's trash bags." || ゴミ袋だぞ。  #c3_0349
natsuki<laugh>: "Trash bags count. In Niigata I signed up for a rice-planting day because they said there'd be free {onigiri|rice balls}. I lost both boots in the mud and walked home in my socks." || ゴミ袋も入るよ。私なんか新潟で、おにぎりタダって聞いて田植え体験に申し込んで、田んぼで長靴を両方なくして、靴下で帰ったんだから。  #c3_0350
> I laugh before I can decide not to.  #c3_0351
> Two landings up, she gives me the same look she gave me at lunch on Monday.  #c3_0352
natsuki<curious>: "How much did you sleep?" || 昨日、何時間寝た？  #c3_0353
kohei(neutral): "Enough." || 足りるくらい。  #c3_0354
natsuki<smile>: "Four hours." || 四時間。  #c3_0355
kohei(surprised): "…Four and a half." || ……四時間半。  #c3_0356
natsuki<curious>: "And you keep shaking out your left hand. Every ten steps or so. You do it in class too. Third period." || あと、左手。十段ごとくらいに振ってる。授業中もやってるよ。三時間目。  #c3_0357
> I hadn't noticed. I stop doing it. A few steps later I catch myself doing it again, and she catches me catching myself, and that's it. I'm gone.  #c3_0358
@show natsuki track_grin
> She turns on the landing and lifts the camera before I can get a hand up.  #c3_0359
natsuki<grin>: "For the progress report." || 進捗報告用。  #c3_0360
> She checks the screen, then holds it out to me.  #c3_0361
> It's me on the steps below her, laughing. Not the polite kind. My eyes are half shut and my mouth is open. I look like somebody's little brother.  #c3_0362
kohei(flustered): "Delete that." || 消せ。  #c3_0363
natsuki<grin>: "Make me." || 消させてみなよ。  #c3_0364
@show natsuki track_smile
